### ICONS
- Library: Lucide React
- Format: SVG
- Default size: 24px
- Stroke width: 2px
- Color: Inherits from text color

### MOTION & ANIMATION

**Library:** GSAP (required)

**Philosophy:** Minimal, calming (mental health context)
- Respect `prefers-reduced-motion`: YES (required)
- Default to reduced motion for mental health audiences
- Never use aggressive or jarring animations

**Timing**
- Micro interactions: 0.3s
- Reveals/transitions: 0.6s
- Page transitions: 1s

**Easing:** power2.out (default)

**Required Animation Components**
- |UXUIDC|FadeInScroll
- |UXUIDC|StaggerAnimation
- |UXUIDC|ParallaxEffect (subtle only)

**Performance Rules**
- Animate only `transform` and `opacity`
- Cleanup in useEffect return
- Use `will-change: transform` sparingly

### DARK MODE
- Support: Not required (light mode default)
- Reasoning: Healthcare/mental health sites typically use light, calm palettes

### IMAGERY GUIDANCE (from Style Guide Inspiration)
- Serene natural imagery: forest paths, water ripples, zen gardens
- Warm, cozy elements: candles, books, coffee, journals
- Growth symbolism: trees, leaves, plants
- Mindfulness visuals: meditation, journaling, peaceful expressions
- Avoid: Clinical/sterile imagery, harsh lighting, isolated individuals

### ACCESSIBILITY (WCAG 2.1 AA)
- Semantic HTML required
- ARIA labels required
- Keyboard navigation required
- Color contrast: 4.5:1 minimum
- Focus indicators visible
- Skip navigation links
- Proper heading hierarchy (H1→H2→H3, never skip)
- Alt text describes emotional context of images
- Form validation supports non-English character sets
- 2-3 minute session timeout warnings

### MENTAL HEALTH SPECIFIC
- 988 Crisis Lifeline visible on EVERY page
- Include: Call, Text, Chat options
- Veterans: Press 1
- Spanish: Presione 2
- Clickable tel: links on mobile
- Additional: Crisis Text Line (741741), NYC Well (888-NYC-WELL)

### FORBIDDEN
- Colored drop shadows (neutral only)
- Content width exceeding 1440px
- Aggressive/urgent animations
- Time pressure UI elements
- Pre checked consent boxes
- Inline styles (except dynamic values)
- Colors outside defined tokens
- Typography outside defined scale
- Skipping heading levels
- Auto playing media
- Bright reds/yellows in primary UI
